<title>VENEZUELA: Venaseta 9-month share falls.</title>
<headline>Venaseta 9-month share falls.</headline>
<dateline>CARACAS 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shr 4.82 bolivars vs 5.35 bolivars</p>
<p>Net 2.288 billion bolivars vs 2.537 billion bolivars</p>
<p>Revs 2.431 billion bolivars vs 2.732 billion bolivars</p>
<p>NOTES: Period ending 31 March, 1997.</p>
<p>Results are inflation-adjusted.</p>
<p>Venaseta is a holding company for textiles and chemicals company Sudamtex</p>
<p>George Soros' Quantum Fund bought a 24 percent stake in Sudamtex last week</p>
<p>((-- Caracas newsroom, 582 505 2600))</p>
</text>
